# GokoWeb — Complete Project Reference

## Project Overview

**GokoWeb** (`goko-premium`) is a full-stack web application for **Goko Hostel & Community Space** in Gokarna, India. It combines a marketing website, guest self check-in, food ordering, kitchen management, financial accounting, and a full operations admin panel.

| Aspect | Details |
|--------|---------|
| **Purpose** | Hostel marketing site + complete operational backend |
| **Domain** | `https://www.gokohostel.com` |
| **Framework** | Next.js 15.5 (App Router), React 19, TypeScript |
| **Styling** | Tailwind CSS, Framer Motion, shadcn/ui (Base Nova) |
| **Forms** | react-hook-form + Zod |
| **Database** | Cloudflare D1 (SQLite) via Drizzle ORM — 24 tables |
| **Deployment** | Cloudflare Workers via @opennextjs/cloudflare |
| **Worker** | `goko-hostel-latest-webpage` (wrangler.jsonc) |
| **Future** | Planned Android mobile app for staff operations |

