## Feature Map

### 1. Public Marketing Site (10 pages)

Home, Stay, Story, Events, Community Area, How to Reach, Things to Do, FAQs, Reviews, Booking Enquiry. Global shell with sticky header, footer, WhatsApp float, Book Now gate (Stayflexi).

### 2. Guest Self Check-in (`/self-checkin`)

- Mobile-first form with ID upload + real-time Vision API validation
- Returning guest lookup by phone (reuses prior Drive links)
- Foreign guest Form C fields + passport/visa OCR (8 languages)
- Booking platform + ID capture
- Uploads to Google Drive; records in D1

### 3. Food Ordering System (`/food-order`, `/kitchen`, `/my-bills`)

**Guest flow:**
- Phone lookup identifies hostel guest (linked to check-in) or walk-in
- Browse menu by category, add to cart (persisted in localStorage)
- Place order with idempotency key; hostel guests billed on tab, walk-ins pay at counter
- Track order status in real-time (10s polling)
- View bills at `/my-bills` — unpaid vs paid, grouped by stay

**Kitchen flow (`/kitchen`):**
- Password-gated staff dashboard with real-time order queue
- Status pipeline: `pending_approval` → `placed` → `preparing` → `ready` → `served`
- Item modifications, void, availability toggle, busy mode
- Web Bluetooth thermal printer support (ESC/POS)

**Admin food management:**
- Menu categories/items CRUD with inventory tracking
- Food settings: kitchen hours, tax rate, tab limits, WhatsApp notifications
- Order management: status updates, void/discount, reassign, combined billing
- Food revenue reporting with guest-wise breakdown

### 4. Accounts & Financial Module

**Five sub-tabs under Admin → Accounts:**

| Tab | Component | Purpose |
|-----|-----------|---------|
| Add Expense | `AdminAddExpense` | Submit expenses with bill photo upload to Google Drive |
| Daily Ledger | `DailyLedger` | Daily income/expense per account, food revenue |
| Records | `AdminBillRecords` | Monthly expense history browser |
| Food Revenue | `AdminFoodBill` | Date-range food revenue with guest breakdown |
| Reconcile | `DailyReconcile` | Cash/account reconciliation (expected vs actual closing) |

**Account Settings (under Management):**

| Section | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| Accounts | Bank/cash account CRUD, default account, opening balances |
| Employees | Staff CRUD with salary, role, frequency |
| Vendors | Vendor directory with categories |
| Bulk Expenses | XLSX bulk import of historical expenses |
| Bulk Income | XLSX bulk import of historical income |

**Salary payments** create both a `salary_payments` record and an auto-generated expense entry.

### 5. Admin Panel (`/admin`)

Eight top-level sections (password-protected):

| Section | Component | Purpose |
|---------|-----------|---------|
| Dashboard | `AdminDashboard` | Today's check-ins/checkouts, occupancy, quick nav |
| Bookings | `AdminBookings` | OTA bookings, Gmail sync |
| Beds | `AdminBeds` | Visual bed map, assign/checkout/change |
| Timeline | `AdminTimeline` | Multi-day occupancy grid |
| Records | `AdminRecords` | Monthly check-in CRUD, Form C |
| Food Orders | `AdminFoodOrders` | Order ops, tabs, payments, embedded kitchen view |
| Accounts | `AdminExpenditure` | Financial module (5 sub-tabs above) |
| Management | `AdminManagement` | 13 sub-tabs below |

**Management sub-tabs (13):**
Dorms, Users, Backup, Audit, Logs, Health & Stats, History, Rates, Menu, Food Settings, Bulk Upload (check-ins), QR Codes, Account Settings

**Roles:** `admin` (full access), `manager` (most features), `staff` (permission-gated)

### 6. QR Code Generator (Admin → Management → QR Codes)

Standalone design tool using `qr-code-styling` library. Staff can create branded QR codes with custom colors, logos, and text. Presets for business card (vCard), Wi-Fi, website, contact. Export PNG/SVG, save/load configurations from history.

### 7. Form C / FRRO Automation

- Passport MRZ + visa OCR parsing (8 languages)
- Local Playwright server for FRRO auto-fill
- Bookmarklet/console script for mobile
- See `frro-form-c-findings.mdc` for full technical details

### 8. Bulk Upload System

Three bulk importers, all following the same pattern: download XLSX template → fill data → upload → validate + deduplicate + insert.

| Importer | Location | API Route |
|----------|----------|-----------|
| Check-in guests | Management → Bulk Upload | `/api/admin/import` |
| Expenses | Account Settings → Bulk Expenses | `/api/admin/bulk-import-accounts` |
| Income | Account Settings → Bulk Income | `/api/admin/bulk-import-accounts` |

